%
( 5 EKSEN - BES YUZ ISLEME, 3+2 KONUMLAMA )
( Makine: "5-axis trunnion" sablonundan uretilen makine )
( Kutuk: 100 x 100 x 60 mm blok, X/Y sifiri ortada, Z0 ust yuzey )
( A ekseni ust yuzeyin 20mm altindan gecer, C tablayi dondurur )
( A90'da yukari bakan yan yuz Z+30'dadir; parcanin ustu Y+20, alti Y-40 tarafindadir )
( Takim ucu merkez kontrolu yoktur: koordinatlar makine eksenleridir )
( T1 = 10mm parmak freze )

G21 G17 G90 G54

T1 M6
S2400 M3
G0 Z120.0
G0 A0.0 C0.0

( --- ust yuz: cap 40, 5mm derin cep, helisel giris --- )
G0 X10.0 Y0.0
G0 Z2.0
G3 X10.0 Y0.0 I-10.0 J0.0 Z-2.5 F250
G3 X10.0 Y0.0 I-10.0 J0.0 Z-5.0
G3 X10.0 Y0.0 I-10.0 J0.0 F400
G1 X15.0
G3 X15.0 Y0.0 I-15.0 J0.0
G1 X5.0
G3 X5.0 Y0.0 I-5.0 J0.0
G1 X0.0
G0 Z120.0

( --- dort yan yuz: her birinde bir kanal ve bir delik --- )
#1 = 0.0
o100 while [#1 LT 359.0]
  G0 A90.0 C#1
  G0 X-30.0 Y-5.0
  G0 Z35.0
  G1 Z26.0 F150
  G1 X30.0 F300
  G0 Z35.0
  G0 X0.0 Y-25.0
  G1 Z22.0 F120
  G0 Z120.0
  #1 = [#1 + 90.0]
o100 endwhile

M5
G0 A0.0 C0.0
G0 X0.0 Y0.0
M2
%
